# SHOWSTOPPER: crates and barrels take three shots and always leave a
# card; a beaten foe leaves one about half the time (the colour is
# random). Crates stand in the way.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat arena
cheat god
cheat spawn crate 168 2440
expect foe0_kind == 1
hold UP 40
expect py >= 2452
cheat face 6
press A 1
wait 10
press A 1
wait 10
expect foe0_alive == 1
press A 1
wait 10
expect foe0_alive == 0
expect cards == 1
